Package: polaros-installer
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: PolarOS Team <dev@polaros.dev>
Installed-Size: 48
Depends: whiptail, parted, e2fsprogs, dosfstools, util-linux, mount, gdisk,
 grub-efi-arm64, squashfs-tools, coreutils, bash, sed, grep
Recommends: debootstrap
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/polaros
Description: PolarOS system installer
 Interactive text installer for PolarOS. Guides the user through disk
 selection, partitioning (GPT with a 512 MiB EFI System Partition and an
 ext4 root), copying the live system, creating an administrator account
 and installing GRUB EFI.
 .
 It works from the PolarOS live ISO and can also install over the network
 with debootstrap on an existing Debian ARM64 system.
